        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "The Company owns several registered trademarks and brand names including but not limited to Goalrilla™, Goalsetter®, Bear Archery®, Gold Tip™, Bee Stinger™, Brunswick Billiards®, Onix®, Ping-Pong®, The Step®, Lifeline® and Woodplay®.",
